      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Doctors use various metrics and tests to assess the risk of actual problems, rather than just waiting for a blockage to occur. Your doctor will look at your overall cholesterol panel, blood pressure, blood sugar levels, and possibly perform tests to see how efficiently your arteries are working. Management focuses on keeping these numbers in a healthy range to slow or prevent the process from becoming dangerous.",
